# WHITELIST: this repository holds CODE ONLY.
# Everything is ignored by default; only the files listed below can
# ever be committed. This blocks raw accelerometer files (.bin),
# sleep/shift logs, GGIR output, CSV/Excel reports and graphs, so no
# participant data can be pushed by accident.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
